    "summary": "Errata rewriting [Warpmeld Sacrifice](vsdata:ability/thousand-sons.warpmeld-pact.warpmeld-sacrifice) (Warpmeld Pact). A **TZEENTCH MUTANT INFANTRY** or **TZEENTCH MUTANT MOUNTED** unit of yours may make a Warpmeld Sacrifice:\n\n- when an enemy unit **selected to shoot** or fight picks it as a target of 1 or more attacks; until the phase ends, subtract 1 from **Wound rolls** for attacks that target it\n- when it is selected to shoot or fight, ahead of picking its targets; until the phase ends, add 1 to Wound rolls for its models' attacks\n\nEach Warpmeld Sacrifice inflicts D3 **mortal wounds** on that **TZEENTCH MUTANT** unit as the phase ends.",
